  WHEN 21 THEN '1. Brown chicken 5 minutes | 2. Add curry paste and cook 2 minutes | 3. Pour coconut milk | 4. Add sweet potato cubes | 5. Simmer 20 minutes | 6. Add spinach and coriander'
  WHEN 22 THEN '1. Cook and mash sweet potatoes | 2. Partially mash beans | 3. Mix with oats, egg and spices | 4. Form 8 patties | 5. Cook 4 minutes each side | 6. Serve with green salad'
  WHEN 23 THEN '1. Peel kiwis and apple | 2. Cut cucumber into pieces | 3. Put all ingredients in blender | 4. Blend 60 seconds until smooth | 5. Serve chilled'
  WHEN 24 THEN '1. Press tofu and cut into slices | 2. Grill tofu 5 minutes each side | 3. Mix peanut butter, soy and lime | 4. Grate cabbage and carrot | 5. Serve tofu on vegetables | 6. Top with peanut sauce'
  WHEN 25 THEN '1. Blend cauliflower into rice grains | 2. Sauté shallots and mushrooms | 3. Add cauliflower and ladle of broth | 4. Cook adding broth gradually | 5. Add parmesan and thyme | 6. Serve immediately'
