  WHEN 38 THEN '1. Cut all vegetables into rounds | 2. Arrange alternating in dish | 3. Drizzle with oil and sprinkle herbs | 4. Bake 30 minutes at 180°C | 5. Make 4 wells in vegetables | 6. Crack eggs and cook 10 minutes'
