  WHEN 42 THEN '1. Beat eggs and milk | 2. Sauté all vegetables 5 minutes | 3. Pour eggs over vegetables | 4. Crumble goat cheese | 5. Cook 5 minutes on stove, then 15 min in oven | 6. Serve warm or cold'
